sequenceDiagram
    participant App
    participant OS as Android Backup
    participant Drive as Google Drive
    participant New as new device

    App->>OS: backup per rules - config and data, NO secrets/caches
    OS->>Drive: upload (encrypted by Google)
    Note over New: user reinstalls / new phone
    Drive-->>New: restore included data
    New->>New: run schema migrations (Ch 36)
    New->>New: secrets absent -> re-authenticate (Ch 19/20)
    New-->>App: restored config/data, user re-logs-in
